{"words": [{"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "يَتَفَرَّقَا", "translation": "they separate"}, {"text": "يُغْنِ", "translation": "will be enriched"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(by) Allah"}, {"text": "كُلًّۭا", "translation": "each (of them)"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "سَعَتِهِۦ ۚ", "translation": "His abundance"}, {"text": "وَكَانَ", "translation": "and is"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَٰسِعًا", "translation": "All-Encompassing"}, {"text": "حَكِيمًۭا", "translation": "All-Wise"}], "sahih": "But if they separate [by divorce], Allāh will enrich each [of them] from His abundance. And ever is Allāh Encompassing and Wise."}